    "constant_origin": "conductor_budget.py module docstring + commit c96bdaf0 (2026-07-25): 'conductor reports $3.44/fire vs $7.69 real'. No standalone census artifact/script found anywhere in the repo -- grepped docs/markdown/analysis for '2.2'/'7.69'/'3.44', ran git log -S on conductor_budget.py, and inspected automation/state/spend-2026-07-25.json (the only same-dated spend snapshot that exists). That snapshot is an ALL-Claude-sessions/day aggregate ($423.39 across sonnet+opus+haiku, 12 sessions) -- NOT conductor-specific, and it does not reproduce $3.44 or $7.69 in any field.",
